  ('Caller', 'CA', "I'll do that, thanks. When does the course run?"),
  ('Administrator', 'GB', "Level Two runs on Tuesday evenings, from seven until nine. There used to be a Thursday group as well, but we've had to cancel that this year because the tutor has moved away."),
